DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260820
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260821
SUMMARY:Lunch: Turkey Sloppy Sub (fresh) / Falafel Wrap (fresh\, halal\, & 
 vegan) / Protein Box (fresh)
DESCRIPTION:\nTurkey Sloppy Sub (fresh)\n    \n \n    \nFalafel Wrap (fre
 sh\, halal\, & vegan)\n    \n \n    \nProtein Box (fresh)\n    \n \n    
 \nOne breakfast is available to all students at no cost. All meals are ser
 ved with fruit variety and 1% low-fat or non-fat chocolate milk (soy milk 
 available upon request). Students must choose at least one fruit option. A
 ll grains offered are whole grain rich. Menu subject to change based on pr
 oduct availability.\n    \nThis institution is an equal opportunity provid
 er.\n
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
